1
00:00:06,120 --> 00:00:08,360
=Episode 7=

2
00:00:48,079 --> 00:00:48,640
Your Highness,

3
00:00:48,640 --> 00:00:50,200
Miss Xi Yuan has been abducted!

4
00:00:53,200 --> 00:00:54,359
(Could it be Father's doing?)

5
00:00:56,079 --> 00:00:57,200
Send men to find her at once.

6
00:00:57,200 --> 00:00:57,679
Understood.

7
00:01:12,680 --> 00:01:13,640
Help!

8
00:01:14,719 --> 00:01:15,760
Quiet.

9
00:01:19,359 --> 00:01:20,079
Keep struggling,

10
00:01:21,120 --> 00:01:22,640
and I'll throw you off right now.

11
00:01:26,120 --> 00:01:26,920
And then,

12
00:01:27,719 --> 00:01:28,920
even a beauty like you

13
00:01:29,560 --> 00:01:31,280
will be nothing but a mangled mess.

14
00:01:32,439 --> 00:01:33,079
Qing Yuluo,

15
00:01:33,599 --> 00:01:34,719
why did you kidnap me?

16
00:01:35,159 --> 00:01:36,959
To take you to Longyuan, naturally.

17
00:01:37,560 --> 00:01:38,799
Jin Yunlie cares so much about you.

18
00:01:39,760 --> 00:01:41,040
That makes you very useful.

19
00:01:43,040 --> 00:01:43,640
Longyuan?

20
00:01:44,159 --> 00:01:45,400
Who says I'm going to Longyuan with you?

21
00:01:54,760 --> 00:01:55,239
Think you can run?

22
00:01:56,000 --> 00:01:56,799
Not so fast.

23
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:03,799
Who's there?

24
00:02:05,560 --> 00:02:06,640
(Another expert?)

25
00:02:08,159 --> 00:02:09,760
(I'm still in Huyun territory.
Better not drag this fight out.)

26
00:02:14,439 --> 00:02:15,000
Shisi,

27
00:02:15,520 --> 00:02:17,000
didn't we agree not to interfere?

28
00:02:54,000 --> 00:02:55,360
(Finally, I've found you.)

29
00:02:57,000 --> 00:02:57,560
You...

30
00:02:57,960 --> 00:02:58,639
Who are you?

31
00:03:28,599 --> 00:03:29,400
Shisi.

32
00:03:37,159 --> 00:03:37,960
Shisi,

33
00:03:39,240 --> 00:03:40,199
you never change.

34
00:03:41,039 --> 00:03:41,639
How many more divine punishments

35
00:03:41,960 --> 00:03:43,639
can that body of yours take?

36
00:03:44,400 --> 00:03:46,800
It's an ironclad divine law
that deities must not aid mortals.

37
00:03:48,120 --> 00:03:48,919
Is it worth

38
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:51,159
doing this?

39
00:03:54,360 --> 00:03:55,240
Let's go.

40
00:04:02,599 --> 00:04:03,360
Are you alright?

41
00:04:05,599 --> 00:04:06,400
I'm fine.

42
00:04:07,039 --> 00:04:08,479
It's just a normal reaction
to sudden weightlessness.

43
00:04:09,240 --> 00:04:10,680
I feel better now that I've thrown up.

44
00:04:12,520 --> 00:04:13,319
Oh, right,

45
00:04:13,719 --> 00:04:15,680
thanks for saving me back there.

46
00:04:15,680 --> 00:04:16,639
It really is you.

47
00:04:17,800 --> 00:04:18,599
You're still alive.

48
00:04:18,719 --> 00:04:20,280
You know me?

49
00:04:23,240 --> 00:04:24,399
You don't remember me?

50
00:04:24,759 --> 00:04:25,800
Sorry,

51
00:04:25,879 --> 00:04:26,519
I don't think we've met.

52
00:04:26,720 --> 00:04:27,079
You don't look familiar.

53
00:04:27,319 --> 00:04:28,319
(She's lost her memory?)

54
00:04:29,279 --> 00:04:30,240
Still,

55
00:04:30,519 --> 00:04:31,879
you feel oddly familiar.

56
00:04:33,639 --> 00:04:34,720
My apologies.

57
00:04:35,560 --> 00:04:36,759
I must have mistaken
you for someone else.

58
00:04:36,920 --> 00:04:37,399
So,

59
00:04:38,120 --> 00:04:40,240
is that person very important to you?

60
00:04:40,720 --> 00:04:41,120
Yeah.

61
00:04:42,319 --> 00:04:43,000
You've heard

62
00:04:43,000 --> 00:04:43,639
the saying:

63
00:04:43,839 --> 00:04:44,800
where there's a will,

64
00:04:44,800 --> 00:04:45,720
there's a way.

65
00:04:45,720 --> 00:04:47,519
I hope you find her soon.

66
00:04:47,519 --> 00:04:48,199
Alright.

67
00:04:53,480 --> 00:04:55,360
I need to go find some food.

68
00:04:55,439 --> 00:04:56,120
I'll be off now.

69
00:04:56,319 --> 00:04:57,000
Thanks again!

70
00:04:58,399 --> 00:04:59,199
Hey, wait up.

71
00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:01,279
I'm getting a bit hungry too, actually.

72
00:05:01,759 --> 00:05:02,680
Why don't we go together?

73
00:05:02,839 --> 00:05:04,360
You're heading to the Huyun Capital too?

74
00:05:05,519 --> 00:05:05,800
Yeah.

75
00:05:06,920 --> 00:05:08,240
Let's go together then.

76
00:05:20,560 --> 00:05:22,319
(Jin Yunlie must be
so worried about me.)

77
00:05:22,720 --> 00:05:24,120
(I need to let him know right away
that I'm okay.)

78
00:05:28,839 --> 00:05:29,959
Is it broken?

79
00:05:30,560 --> 00:05:31,399
Never mind for now.

80
00:05:31,759 --> 00:05:33,120
I'll deal with it
once we reach the Huyun Capital.

81
00:05:34,519 --> 00:05:35,319
(I'm sorry.)

82
00:05:36,519 --> 00:05:38,000
(I can't let him find you just yet.)

83
00:05:39,240 --> 00:05:40,399
(I still need a little more time...)

84
00:05:41,800 --> 00:05:43,160
(There's something I need to verify.)

85
00:05:50,639 --> 00:05:50,959
Your Highness,

86
00:05:51,199 --> 00:05:53,000
why did the Whispering Bell
respond just now,

87
00:05:53,000 --> 00:05:54,279
then suddenly go silent?

88
00:05:55,079 --> 00:05:55,959
Someone must have placed

89
00:05:55,959 --> 00:05:57,240
a restriction

90
00:05:57,240 --> 00:05:58,160
on Xi Yuan's Whispering Bell.

91
00:05:58,839 --> 00:05:59,879
Should I...

92
00:05:59,879 --> 00:06:00,319
No need.

93
00:06:02,680 --> 00:06:03,680
The restriction can be lifted.

94
00:06:04,199 --> 00:06:06,439
It just takes a little extra effort,
that's all.

95
00:06:06,439 --> 00:06:07,720
Return immediately

96
00:06:07,720 --> 00:06:08,839
and assist Lou Jingou

97
00:06:09,079 --> 00:06:10,439
in identifying the assassin.

98
00:06:10,600 --> 00:06:11,839
Tighten the patrols.

99
00:06:11,839 --> 00:06:12,920
The Huyun Imperial Palace

100
00:06:13,120 --> 00:06:14,360
is not open to just anyone.

101
00:06:14,959 --> 00:06:15,560
Yes, Your Highness.

102
00:06:18,079 --> 00:06:18,480
(Xi Yuan,)

103
00:06:19,639 --> 00:06:20,800
(please be safe.)

104
00:06:29,000 --> 00:06:31,920
♪Look there, upon a withered bough♪

105
00:06:32,840 --> 00:06:37,360
♪A green shoot with roots in decay♪

106
00:06:38,600 --> 00:06:43,800
♪If only I could stay,
quietly holding on♪

107
00:06:46,079 --> 00:06:47,879
Why isn't this bell working?

108
00:06:47,959 --> 00:06:50,399
I've been calling forever,
but Jin Yunlie hasn't answered.

109
00:06:56,839 --> 00:06:57,800
What's this?

110
00:06:59,079 --> 00:07:00,199
Braised pork buns?

111
00:07:00,199 --> 00:07:01,160
Are they a Huyun specialty?

112
00:07:01,160 --> 00:07:02,319
I've never had one before.

113
00:07:02,399 --> 00:07:03,519
Sir, I'll take three, please.

114
00:07:04,199 --> 00:07:04,639
Coming right up.

115
00:07:05,079 --> 00:07:05,839
Just a moment.

116
00:07:06,079 --> 00:07:06,560
Make it four.

117
00:07:06,759 --> 00:07:08,279
You're treating me to just one bun?

118
00:07:09,800 --> 00:07:10,639
It's only one bun,

119
00:07:10,639 --> 00:07:11,839
but it's the thought that counts.

120
00:07:13,800 --> 00:07:14,759
Let me go!

121
00:07:15,000 --> 00:07:15,560
You brat!

122
00:07:15,560 --> 00:07:16,160
Let go of me!

123
00:07:16,399 --> 00:07:17,639
I'll kill you right here, you hear me?

124
00:07:17,800 --> 00:07:18,600
Let go!

125
00:07:18,680 --> 00:07:19,439
Please help me!

126
00:07:19,439 --> 00:07:21,319
I don't want to be sold as a slave!

127
00:07:21,439 --> 00:07:21,920
You don't want to?

128
00:07:22,319 --> 00:07:22,680
Let go!

129
00:07:22,680 --> 00:07:23,759
You owe me a lot of money, brat!

130
00:07:24,120 --> 00:07:24,439
Move!

131
00:07:24,600 --> 00:07:25,720
You're going on that blind date now!

132
00:07:25,879 --> 00:07:26,360
Come on!

133
00:07:26,560 --> 00:07:27,639
I'm not going, Mom!

134
00:07:27,639 --> 00:07:28,199
You're not going?

135
00:07:28,279 --> 00:07:29,399
I'm your mother!

136
00:07:29,399 --> 00:07:31,240
If I say you're going, you're going!

137
00:07:32,199 --> 00:07:33,040
Let her go.

138
00:07:33,639 --> 00:07:34,399
Mind your own business!

139
00:07:34,839 --> 00:07:35,519
Take it.

140
00:07:37,399 --> 00:07:38,199
Let me go!

141
00:07:47,040 --> 00:07:47,839
You won't take the hint?

142
00:07:47,839 --> 00:07:48,639
Then we'll do this the hard way.

143
00:07:48,879 --> 00:07:49,560
Miss.

144
00:07:49,560 --> 00:07:49,959
Don't be scared.

145
00:07:49,959 --> 00:07:50,839
I'm right here with you.

146
00:08:04,120 --> 00:08:06,079
Your Spiritual Power is way too weak.

147
00:08:06,079 --> 00:08:08,040
Weak or not, let's find out.

148
00:08:09,439 --> 00:08:10,040
Go!

149
00:08:19,959 --> 00:08:21,240
As long as I'm here,

150
00:08:21,319 --> 00:08:22,839
no one is taking her away.

151
00:08:25,959 --> 00:08:27,600
See? He's no match for me.

152
00:08:27,959 --> 00:08:30,199
No one can ever sell you again.

153
00:08:30,720 --> 00:08:31,399
Really?

154
00:08:31,839 --> 00:08:33,040
He really won't come after me again?

155
00:08:34,399 --> 00:08:35,079
Don't worry.

156
00:08:35,639 --> 00:08:37,319
No one will bully you anymore,

157
00:08:37,319 --> 00:08:38,919
or force you to do things
you don't want to do.

158
00:08:40,240 --> 00:08:41,519
I believe you, miss.

159
00:08:47,240 --> 00:08:47,759
Alright, off you go now.

160
00:08:47,960 --> 00:08:48,840
Go home.

161
00:08:51,759 --> 00:08:53,480
Thank you, miss.

162
00:08:54,000 --> 00:08:54,519
But...

163
00:08:55,159 --> 00:08:55,879
I'm sorry.

164
00:08:59,919 --> 00:09:00,399
Fine.

165
00:09:00,639 --> 00:09:01,799
I won't be the bad guy.

166
00:09:01,799 --> 00:09:03,639
How much does that little girl owe you?

167
00:09:03,720 --> 00:09:04,440
Twenty taels.

168
00:09:04,919 --> 00:09:05,480
Fine.

169
00:09:05,559 --> 00:09:06,759
I'll pay what she owes.

170
00:09:08,000 --> 00:09:09,879
But if you ever bully her again,

171
00:09:09,879 --> 00:09:11,320
I won't go easy on you.

172
00:09:13,639 --> 00:09:14,559
Where's my coin pouch?

173
00:09:15,720 --> 00:09:17,240
You don't even have the money,
yet you're still sticking your nose in?

174
00:09:18,600 --> 00:09:19,320
Listen up,

175
00:09:19,320 --> 00:09:20,399
I'm not taking a loss on this.

176
00:09:20,919 --> 00:09:22,320
She owes me money. I have it in writing.

177
00:09:22,639 --> 00:09:23,799
Even if you take this
to the authorities,

178
00:09:24,039 --> 00:09:24,840
I'll still win.

179
00:09:24,879 --> 00:09:25,799
What's the rush?

180
00:09:25,840 --> 00:09:27,799
I said I'll pay you, and I will.

181
00:09:32,000 --> 00:09:33,159
Your coin pouch is right here.

182
00:09:39,720 --> 00:09:41,919
How did my coin pouch end up with you?

183
00:09:42,000 --> 00:09:42,360
Hey,

184
00:09:42,559 --> 00:09:43,200
there's the money.

185
00:09:43,200 --> 00:09:43,879
Hand it over!

186
00:09:45,960 --> 00:09:46,759
Here.

187
00:09:52,240 --> 00:09:53,440
This isn't over.

188
00:09:53,440 --> 00:09:54,320
You'll be sorry!

189
00:09:55,519 --> 00:09:56,440
What happened?

190
00:09:59,919 --> 00:10:01,120
You stole it?

191
00:10:02,840 --> 00:10:03,639
Hey.

192
00:10:03,879 --> 00:10:05,320
Get up. Talk to me.

193
00:10:05,879 --> 00:10:07,120
I'm sorry, miss.

194
00:10:07,440 --> 00:10:09,120
It was me. I stole your coin pouch.

195
00:10:09,440 --> 00:10:12,000
My mother's illness
can't go untreated any longer.

196
00:10:13,480 --> 00:10:14,039
Miss,

197
00:10:14,320 --> 00:10:15,799
you both have great Spiritual Power.

198
00:10:16,039 --> 00:10:17,600
Please, can you save my mother?

199
00:10:18,279 --> 00:10:20,279
She's dying.

200
00:10:39,080 --> 00:10:40,000
You useless fool!

201
00:10:44,639 --> 00:10:45,720
Great Demon Lord,
please calm your wrath.

202
00:10:46,039 --> 00:10:47,919
There was a formidable expert nearby,

203
00:10:47,960 --> 00:10:49,159
far stronger than I am.

204
00:10:49,399 --> 00:10:51,080
Please, Great Demon Lord,
grant me one more chance.

205
00:10:51,159 --> 00:10:51,679
This time,

206
00:10:52,279 --> 00:10:53,840
I'll capture her and bring her to you.

207
00:10:54,279 --> 00:10:56,480
You'd better succeed.

208
00:10:58,960 --> 00:11:01,000
If I can get my hands on her,

209
00:11:02,159 --> 00:11:04,159
killing Jin Yunlie would be nothing.

210
00:11:04,840 --> 00:11:06,600
The entire Xuanji Realm

211
00:11:07,200 --> 00:11:09,519
would be mine for the taking.

212
00:11:39,559 --> 00:11:40,679
We're almost there. Just up ahead.

213
00:11:43,159 --> 00:11:44,120
This is my home.

214
00:11:59,960 --> 00:12:05,560
♪A love letter, a passionate pursuit,
the envy of everyone♪

215
00:12:06,760 --> 00:12:12,360
♪Bouquets and heartfelt confessions,
leaving me moved and fulfilled♪

216
00:12:13,560 --> 00:12:19,160
♪No matter how long or hard our road,
I don't care♪

217
00:12:19,400 --> 00:12:25,960
♪But you left me with this pain,
forever beyond redemption♪
